Package: swaydesk-common
Architecture: all
Pre-Depends: ${misc:Pre-Depends}, swaydesk-dpkg-includes (= ${source:Version})
Depends: hicolor-icon-theme, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: libnotify-bin
Breaks: swaydesk-desktop (<< 0.1.7~), swaydesk-scripts (<< 0.1.7~)
Replaces: swaydesk-desktop (<< 0.1.7~), swaydesk-scripts (<< 0.1.7~)
Description: Sway desktop components - shared data
 The translations, the Symbols Nerd Font (the icons) and the helper scripts
 and modules more than one component uses, shared by the
 swaydesk components: a dock, a
 notification daemon, Waybar popups and icons, an app grid and the theme
 tools, written in Rust and GTK 4 for wlroots compositors with
 layer-shell (Sway, Hyprland, river, niri).

Package: swaydesk-dpkg-includes
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: Sway desktop components - keep translations on minimized systems
 A dpkg filter that keeps the swaydesk translations on minimized systems,
 such as the Ubuntu server and cloud images, whose dpkg configuration
 drops every translation. It only brings back the swaydesk files; the
 other packages are left as they are.

