Package: swaydesk-network
Architecture: any
Depends: swaydesk-common (= ${source:Version}), ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: network-manager
Breaks: swaydesk-desktop (<< 0.1.7~), swaydesk-widgets (<< 0.1.7~)
Replaces: swaydesk-desktop (<< 0.1.7~), swaydesk-widgets (<< 0.1.7~)
Description: Swaydesk network icon and popup
 Wi-Fi, wired and VPN: turn them on and off, connect and see the details.
 Works with NetworkManager, and also with iwd and systemd-networkd (VPN
 only with NetworkManager). With iwd, the popup asks for the Wi-Fi
 password itself; with NetworkManager, a secrets agent must be running
 to ask for it, such as nm-applet, which the Swaydesk session starts.

