Package: swaydesk-caffeine
Architecture: any
Depends: swaydesk-common (= ${source:Version}), ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, swayidle
Recommends: swaydesk-lock
Breaks: swaydesk-desktop (<< 0.1.7~), swaydesk-scripts (<< 0.1.7~), swaydesk-widgets (<< 0.1.7~)
Replaces: swaydesk-desktop (<< 0.1.7~), swaydesk-scripts (<< 0.1.7~), swaydesk-widgets (<< 0.1.7~)
Description: Swaydesk caffeine popup
 Keeps the screen from locking and the computer from sleeping for 1 hour,
 2 hours or always. In the Swaydesk session it works through its own
 swayidle (sway-idle), which locks the screen with swaydesk-lock; in a plain
 Sway it leaves the user's swayidle alone and holds a Wayland idle
 inhibitor (swaydesk-caffeinate) instead.

