Depends: swaydesk-calendar (>= ${source:Version}), swaydesk-calendar (<< ${source:Version}.1~), swaydesk-weather (>= ${source:Version}), swaydesk-weather (<< ${source:Version}.1~), swaydesk-audio (>= ${source:Version}), swaydesk-audio (<< ${source:Version}.1~), swaydesk-network (>= ${source:Version}), swaydesk-network (<< ${source:Version}.1~), swaydesk-bluetooth (>= ${source:Version}), swaydesk-bluetooth (<< ${source:Version}.1~), swaydesk-battery (>= ${source:Version}), swaydesk-battery (<< ${source:Version}.1~), swaydesk-brightness (>= ${source:Version}), swaydesk-brightness (<< ${source:Version}.1~), swaydesk-caffeine (>= ${source:Version}), swaydesk-caffeine (<< ${source:Version}.1~), swaydesk-system (>= ${source:Version}), swaydesk-system (<< ${source:Version}.1~), swaydesk-media (>= ${source:Version}), swaydesk-media (<< ${source:Version}.1~), swaydesk-clipboard (>= ${source:Version}), swaydesk-clipboard (<< ${source:Version}.1~), swaydesk-osd (>= ${source:Version}), swaydesk-osd (<< ${source:Version}.1~), swaydesk-language (>= ${source:Version}), swaydesk-language (<< ${source:Version}.1~), ${misc:Depends}
Description: Swaydesk bar items (metapackage)
 Every popup and icon of the bar, without the window apps. It includes the
 volume and brightness indicator, which the volume and brightness keys
 show next to the bar.
 .
 This is an empty package that depends on the others.

